---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ReferencePhoto from '../components/ReferencePhoto.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Home" description="An independent owner's reference for the 2021 Volvo S60 T5 Inscription AWD.">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <p class="home-kicker">Independent owner's reference · 2021 model year</p>
    <h1>Volvo S60<br />T5 Inscription AWD</h1>
    <p>A practical workshop-style reference for understanding, maintaining, and caring for the S60. Organized by vehicle system, with procedures, diagrams, specifications, and troubleshooting notes.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="vehicle-strip" aria-label="Vehicle details">
    <div><span>Model</span><strong>2021 S60 T5 Inscription</strong></div>
    <div><span>Drivetrain</span><strong>All-wheel drive</strong></div>
    <div><span>Exterior</span><strong>Denim Blue</strong></div>
  </div>

  <section class="home-photo-section">
    <p class="home-section-label">Workshop reference / systems in view</p>
    <div class="photo-grid">
      <ReferencePhoto src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Under_the_hood_of_car.jpg?width=1100" alt="Close-up view of an automobile engine bay" caption="Engine bay and service components" credit="Envy fstop" source="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Under_the_hood_of_car.jpg" license="CC BY-SA 4.0" />
      <ReferencePhoto src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Turbocharger_assembly.jpg?width=1100" alt="Close-up of a turbocharger assembly" caption="Turbocharger assembly" credit="Panoha" source="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Turbocharger_assembly.jpg" license="CC BY-SA 3.0" />
      <ReferencePhoto src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Disc_brakes.jpg?width=1100" alt="Close-up photograph of a vehicle disc brake rotor" caption="Disc brake rotor" credit="Envy fstop" source="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Disc_brakes.jpg" license="CC BY-SA 4.0" />
    </div>
    <p class="photo-disclaimer">Representative automotive reference photographs. They are not photographs of this specific S60 and do not establish vehicle-specific fitment or procedure.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="note"><strong>Before working on the car.</strong> Equipment varies by VIN, market, and production date. Verify fluids, fasteners, parts, and safety-critical procedures against official Volvo service information for the specific vehicle.</div>

  <p class="home-section-label">Reference library / browse by system</p>
  <nav class="home-links" aria-label="Browse reference sections">
    <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'parts/'}>Visual parts atlas — explore the car by image</a>
    <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'introduction/'}>Vehicle overview and specifications</a>
    <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'exterior/'}>Exterior, body, and paint</a>
    <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'interior/'}>Interior, seats, and controls</a>
    <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'infotainment/'}>Infotainment and displays</a>
    <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'driving/'}>Driving and vehicle operation</a>
    <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'maintenance/'}>Maintenance and service schedule</a>
    <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'repairs/'}>Repairs and DIY references</a>
    <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'troubleshooting/'}>Troubleshooting and warnings</a>
    <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'technical/'}>Technical systems and diagrams</a>
    <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'resources/'}>Manuals and source references</a>
  </nav>

  <h2>Using this reference</h2>
  <p>Use the search field to find a component, warning, fluid, or procedure. The navigation follows the vehicle's major systems. Pages distinguish general owner guidance from information that must be confirmed in VIN-specific factory service data.</p>
  <p>This is an independent owner-maintained project. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Volvo Cars.</p>
</BaseLayout>
